# Fog to black: black beyond the walls; the far floor (1st person: under the walls; iso: the
# top of the screen) darkens to black, the near floor stays clear.
wait 17
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
press b 6
wait 1
shot dark_iso
press down
wait 2
shot dark_north
press right
wait 1.5
shot dark_east
# Full speed towards the east wall, to see it close up
press c 6
wait 6
shot dark_east_near
